        "tr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Ücretsiz katmanda günde üç ipucu var ve hepsi bütün bulmacalar arasında paylaşılıyor. Yarın yenileniyor."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The free tier includes three new puzzles a day. Three more arrive tomorrow, the Daily Puzzle is always free, and anything you have already started is still there to finish." : {
